  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Wash the rice, then soak it 20–30 minutes in the water.</li><li>Cook it (rice cooker or pot): <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"450\" data-s=\"0\">450 g</span> raw makes about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"990\" data-s=\"0\">990 g</span> cooked — enough for 9 hand-shaped onigiri of ~<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"110\" data-s=\"0\">110 g</span>.</li><li>Plain rice — no vinegar, no sugar. The salt goes on your hands.</li></ul>",
